# Optional override for the RiseCurrent Insight origin (no trailing slash, no /analyze path).
# Canonical production hostname: https://ebs-insight.vercel.app
# Internal fallback alias: https://ebs-insight-v2.vercel.app
# Local example: http://localhost:3001
# NEXT_PUBLIC_EBS_INSIGHT_URL=

# Server-only commercial inquiry handoff to Insight. Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Shared secret (same name as Insight). Required before a submission is forwarded.
# Use at least 16 random characters; 32+ is better.
# COMMERCIAL_INQUIRY_SECRET=
# Optional absolute URL override. Defaults to {Insight origin}/api/commercial-inquiries.
# RISECURRENT_COMMERCIAL_INQUIRY_URL=
